  "assembly_findings": [
    "All three controls retain166 exact complete functions and every one of the175 other function body hashes,25 typed objects and11 typed overlapping fields. All native operands resolve.",
    "Direct vt and direct vd preserve original arithmetic extents. Direct vs increases the VADD and VSUB bodies by16 bytes while retaining the other three extents.",
    "All15 changed arithmetic loops still begin with selector-mask/offset loads. All five originals begin with carry evaluation: LEA ECX, MOV EAX,1, SHL EAX,CL, followed by flag extraction. No tested individual cached-field elimination fixes this common dataflow discrepancy.",
    "Some positional byte counts decrease for VSUT, but none of the complete functions matches. No source promotion is based on those counts."
  ],
